      "en_US": [
        "Erik: Where’s Sara?\n",
        "I said I’d meet her here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_FuchsiaCity_Text_ItemBallInThere",
      "en_US": [
        "That item ball in there…\n",
        "Were you wanting that?\r",
        "Me, too!\n",
        "…Huh? That’s a Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_FuchsiaCity_Text_DidYouTrySafariGame",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you try the Safari Game?\r",
        "There are some rare Pokémon that\n",
        "can only be caught there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_FuchsiaCity_Text_SafariZoneZooInFront",
      "en_US": [
        "The Safari Zone has a zoo in front\n",
        "of the entrance.\r",
        "Out back is the Safari Game for\n",
        "catching Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
